  "doc": "Weapon art by weapon id (weapon-art lane; docs/art/weapons.md). held = top-down part for the cutout rig, pointing +x; grip_px = where the claw closes (attach point), muzzle_px = the bore tip (shots and the muzzle flash spawn here); length_px = tail-to-tip span in the part, drawn length_m long in the world (the rig scale is 320 part px per metre). pickup = side view lying on the floor; icon = HUD silhouette. fx anchor_px = the point placed on the muzzle (flash) or the head (projectile); fx cells draw at fx_draw_scale x the rig part scale (2.0: at 1.0 a pistol flash is a speck at 32 px/m). parts = loose extra parts (the flamethrower's tank; mag = the reload magazine the off claw carries, drawn at the held part's scale, feed end +x); part_grip_px = where the claw holds a part.",
